# Databricks Contracts App - Documentation

## Project Overview
A React/Next.js application with FastAPI backend deployed on Databricks Apps for managing PDF contracts, with integration to Unity Catalog, SQL Warehouse, and Databricks services. 

**Architecture**: Static Next.js frontend served by FastAPI backend (following official Databricks Apps best practices for React applications). 

